tps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487928?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antiagainst","id":487928,"login":"antiagainst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzkyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487928?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antiagainst","id":487928,"login":"antiagainst","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4NzkyOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antiagainst","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"The following example convert wrong values from `uint8`:\r\n```llvm\r\nfunc @main(%1: tensor<4xui8>) -> (tensor<4xf32>, tensor<4xi32>) attributes { llvm.emit_c_interface } {\r\n  %2 = \"mhlo.convert\"(%1) : (tensor<4xui8>) -> tensor<4xf32>\r\n  %3 = \"mhlo.convert\"(%1) : (tensor<4xui8>) -> tensor<4xi32>\r\n  return %2, %3 : tensor<4xf32>, tensor<4xi32>\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOutputs:\r\n```shell\r\n$ iree-run-mlir --iree-input-type=mhlo --iree-hal-target-backends=vulkan --function-input=\"4xui8=[0,127,128,255]\" test.mlir\r\nEXEC @main\r\nresult[0]: hal.buffer_view\r\n4xf32=0 127 4.29497E+09 4.29497E+09\r\nresult[1]: hal.buffer_view\r\n4xi32=0 127 -128 -1\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhile in `dylib` backend the output is:\r\n```shell\r\n$ iree-run-mlir --iree-input-type=mhlo --iree-hal-target-backends=dylib --function-input=\"4xui8=[0,127,128,255]\" test.mlir\r\nEXEC @main \r\nresult[0]: hal.buffer_view\r\n4xf32=0 127 128 255\r\nresult[1]: hal.buffer_view\r\n4xi32=0 127 128 255\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice that in the `vulkan` backend some `uint8` becomes negative, and generate different values than `dylib` backend, seems like `vulkan` backend thinks the value is an `int8` instead of `uint8`.\r\n\r\n","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820/comments","created_at":"2022-04-08T15:18:30Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/8820","id":1197458490,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1553038945,"name":"bug 🐞","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUzMDM4OTQ1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/bug%20%F0%9F%90%9E"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"A41E22","default":false,"description":"SPIR-V code generation compiler backend","id":2218521669,"name":"codegen/spirv","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjE4NTIxNjY5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/labels/codegen/spirv"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDODGgK6M5HX8Q6","number":8820,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree","state":"open","state_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820/timeline","title":"[Vulkan] Wrong values in `mhlo.convert` for `uint8` input tensors","type":null,"updated_at":"2023-04-05T04:49:42Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/8820","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/322030?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/edubart","id":322030,"login":"edubart","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMjAzMA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/edubart","user_view_type":"public"}},"pages":{"comments":[{"page":1,"records":1,"sha256":"ec40b7a92432839e60fa5edfdd7993f2f8e2f52